msgstr "بناء تطبيق"

#: site/home.md
msgid "The steps to build an implementation, in the order their dependencies require. Each step tells you clearly when it's done."
msgstr ""

#: site/home.md
msgid "[Follow the steps]{1}"
msgstr "[اتبع الخطوات]{1}"

#: site/home.md
msgid "Implementations"
msgstr "التطبيقات"

#: site/home.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "Build it from open-source components on Kubernetes, or on Databricks in Azure, and see exactly where the two differ."
msgstr "برمجيات مفتوحة المصدر على Kubernetes، أو Databricks على Azure، وأين يختلفان بالضبط."

#: site/home.md
msgid "[Compare the stacks]{1}"
msgstr "[قارن بين المجموعتين]{1}"

#: site/home.md
msgid "Example products"
msgstr "منتجات توضيحية"

#: site/home.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "Document review and an annual census, two products that each run through every layer of the platform."
msgstr "مراجعة الوثائق وتعداد سنوي، يمر كل منهما بجميع طبقات المنصة."

#: site/home.md
msgid "[See them work]{1}"
msgstr "[شاهدها تعمل]{1}"

